  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would love it for a portal to have the option to have a set instance (changeable by Udon) such that if a world with that instance exists it will always lead to it, or create a new instance with that id. This would be super helpful in an rp to expand a map, and allow people to go between without needing to join on someone. I assume creating a portal like this will mean every time someone goes through it will go to that world even full, so maybe some options like create new instance if full, or a list of instance ids they can go to.",
